{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的话句切分得更碎，人物心理变化的因果铺陈不如 X 连贯，尤其少了部分有价值的自我追问。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点词有明显视觉锚点，感受又按照音乐进程分批出现，实际观看时更容易扫读，不必同时处理一大堆短词。反复出现的「自己人」「受气」「回去」「一个人承担」形成了清楚的情感线索，而且音乐变化与身体感受的对应更细腻具体。X 的优势是完整长句更容易交代人物犹豫的来由，但整体而言，Y 更能让普通观众边听边看，既跟得上故事，也能感受到音乐内部细微的情绪变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "63b008cb-ab54-4691-9c27-50ee8079d152", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T204936480559Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:50:34.136732+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ae5cb4b9454769bcaaeffcda426e70c48ffe1c928d3b3df1a5cbdf4990eed0bd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments